! Exact d_n(1/2)^2 and s_n(1/2) for n <= nmax from the Gram matrix of Proposition 4.1
! (no zeta, no quadrature), to check dn_f90.txt.  Cost ~ nmax^4/10 operations.
! Usage (from fotran/): ./riemann_gram_exact checks/riemann_gram_exact.nml  ->  checks/dn_exact.txt
&params
  nmax     = 1280,
  nthreads = 4,
  out_file = 'checks/dn_exact.txt'
/
